23. text() vs . vs normalize-space()
Fragile

//span[text()='Product']

Could fail because:


<span>
    Product
</span>

or nested markup:


<span>
    <b>Product</b>
</span>

Better

//span[normalize-space()='Product']

More flexible

//span[contains(normalize-space(),'Product')]

If text is nested

//*[normalize-space(.)='Product']

You should use normalize-space() heavily in your application.

