38. Understand the difference between these waits
This is essential.

Presence

presenceOfElementLocated()

Means:



Element exists in DOM.
It does not mean visible.

Visibility

visibilityOfElementLocated()

Means:



Element exists and is visible.
Clickable

elementToBeClickable()

Means effectively:



Element is visible and enabled enough to click.
If your element is outside a scrollable viewport, clickable waiting may continue failing.

