71. PrimeNG reusable dropdown method
Eventually you want something like:


public void selectPrimeNGDropdown(
        By dropdown,
        String option) {

    WebElement element =
        waitForVisibility(dropdown);

    scrollToElement(dropdown);

    waitForClickable(dropdown).click();

    By optionLocator = By.xpath(
        "//li[@role='option' and " +
        "normalize-space(@aria-label)='" +
        option.trim() + "']"
    );

    WebElement visibleOption = wait.until(driver ->
        driver.findElements(optionLocator)
            .stream()
            .filter(WebElement::isDisplayed)
            .findFirst()
            .orElse(null)
    );

    visibleOption.click();
}

Then your page code becomes:


selectPrimeNGDropdown(
    getTableDropdown("Commission Details",
